<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC40.037 New design by Robert H. Long.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Name comes from The Duchess Cut(TM) outline</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Use CAM preform for outline</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="284">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="302">41 facets + 6 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">2-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">L/W = 1.900  T/W = 0.974  U/W = 0.500</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">P/W = 0.572 C/W = 0.198</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">Vol/W&#179; = 0.474</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">pc40037.asc</tspan>
